# The virtual environment uv creates for this package, and the one artifact only this package
# produces: every gate step needing python resolves an interpreter here (scripts/_lib.sh), so the
# path is fixed rather than incidental. Everything else the backend generates -- bytecode, the ruff
# and pytest caches, a local .env, a stray key -- appears in more than one directory and is ignored
# tree-wide from the root file instead.
.venv/
